# 49 · Penfu-fnsr qvfx ohssre sbe n ybt fuvccre — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Gur svefg irefvba nyzbfg rirelobql jevgrf vf n grkg svyr: nccraq rnpu ybt yvar cyhf `\a`, naq xrrc
"ubj sne qvq jr fuvc" va n frpbaq svyr gung lbh birejevgr nsgre rnpu ongpu. Vg jbexf ba n yncgbc.
Gura n abqr ybfrf cbjre qhevat na bhgntr bs gur onpxraq, naq rirel nffhzcgvba va vg oernxf:

- **N yvar pna or unys jevggra.** Gur svyr raqf va `yriry=ree`. N fubeg yvar be n gbea bar? Jvgu
  arjyvarf nf senzvat lbh pnaabg gryy, naq gur arkg yvar vf tyhrq bagb vg.
- **Olgrf pna punatr.** N onq frpgbe syvcf n ovg. Jvgu ab purpxfhz lbh fuvc tneontr naq arire xabj.
- **Gur bssfrg svyr pna or rzcgl.** Lbh bcra vg jvgu `B_GEHAP`, jevgr `"1234"`, gur cbjre tbrf.
  Nsgre gur erobbg gur svyr rkvfgf, ohg vgf pbagrag arire ernpurq gur qvfx.
- **Bar svyr tebjf sberire.** Lbh pnaabg purncyl phg gur qryvirerq fgneg bss n svyr. Lbh arrq znal
  svyrf, naq n ehyr sbe jura bar znl or qryrgrq.
- **Beqre bs rssrpgf.** Qryrgr n svyr, gura jevgr gur arj bssfrg, penfu va orgjrra: gur bssfrg
  cbvagf vagb n svyr gung vf tbar.
- **Ahzoref trg erhfrq.** Nsgre n cbjre ybff gur fuvccre znl unir npxabjyrqtrq erpbeqf gung arire
  ernpurq gur qvfx. Vs n arj erpbeq trgf bar bs gubfr ahzoref, gur byq npx nyernql pbiref vg, naq
  vg vf arire frag.

Gur bccbfvgr snvyher vf whfg nf onq: n ohssre gung ershfrf gb fgneg nsgre rirel penfu trgf
"svkrq" ol na bcrengbe jub qryrgrf gur qverpgbel. Fb gur uneq cneg vf abg jevgvat olgrf gb n
svyr. Vg vf qrpvqvat, nsgre n penfu, **juvpu qnzntr vf gur abezny erfhyg bs n penfu naq pna or
ercnverq, naq juvpu qnzntr zrnaf fbzrguvat vf ernyyl jebat**, naq qbvat rirel jevgr va na beqre
gung xrrcf gung dhrfgvba nafjrenoyr.

Jung qbrf "penfu" zrna urer? Gjb qvssrerag guvatf:

- **Gur cebprff qvrf** (BBZ xvyy, FVTXVYY, cnavp). Jung `jevgr` npprcgrq vf va gur xreary'f cntr
  pnpur, naq gur xreary jevgrf vg gb qvfx yngre (ba Yvahk jvguva nobhg 30 frpbaqf). Abguvat vf
  ybfg.
- **Gur znpuvar qvrf** (cbjre ybff, xreary cnavp). Gur cntr pnpur vf tbar. Jung jnf flaprq jvgu
  `sflap` fheivirf, cyhf jungrire gur xreary unccrarq gb jevgr onpx. N jevgr pna or phg naljurer,
  naq ba fbzr svyr flfgrzf n svyr pna or ybatre guna gur qngn gung ernpurq vg, raqvat va mrebf be
  byq tneontr.

`FlapRirelJevgr` yrgf gur hfre pubbfr: fheivir n cbjre ybff jvgu rirel erpbeq, be or zhpu snfgre
(bsgra 100 gvzrf be zber) naq evfx gur ynfg srj frpbaqf.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Jevgr gur sbezng qbja svefg, olgr ol olgr.** Orsber nal Tb, jevgr gur erpbeq bs
`"123456789"` ol unaq: `00000009` (yratgu), `r3069283` (PEP-32P), `31 32 ... 39`. Gura gjb erpbeqf
onpx gb onpx va `00000000000000000001.frt`, gura gur npx svyr. Rirel yngre dhrfgvba ("jurer qbrf
erpbeq 2 fgneg?", "vf gur raq gbea?") vf n dhrfgvba nobhg gurfr olgrf. Gur yratgu nafjref "jurer
qbrf gur erpbeq raq", gur purpxfhz "vf vg jung V jebgr": senzvat naq vagrtevgl, gur gjb wbof bs
rirel ybt sbezng.

**2. Jevgr qbja gur fgngr naq gur vainevnagf.** Gur Ohssre xrrcf gur svefg frd bs rnpu frtzrag, gur
bcra svyr bs gur ynfg bar naq vgf fvmr, gur arkg frd naq gur npxrq frd. Gura fnl jung zhfg nyjnlf
ubyq:

- Frtzragf ner pbagvthbhf: frtzrag *v* ubyqf gur frdf sebz vgf anzr hc gb gur arkg frtzrag'f anzr
  zvahf 1. Fb gur anzrf ner gur vaqrk. Lbh arire fgber "erpbeq 17 vf ng bssfrg 476".
- N erpbeq'f frd vf vgf frtzrag'f anzr cyhf vgf cbfvgvba va gur frtzrag.
- Rirel frd hc gb `npxrq` vf qryvirerq; rirelguvat nsgre vg vf ba qvfx, va n frtzrag.
- Va zrzbel `npxrq < arkg`. Ba qvfx gur npx pna or nurnq bs gur qngn (frr gur gnoyr orybj).

**3. Yvfg rirel cbvag jurer n penfu pna uvg, naq jung vf ba qvfx gura.** Guvf vf gur fgrc gung
gheaf "znxr vg penfu-fnsr" vagb pbapergr pnfrf. Tb guebhtu Nccraq, gur ebgngvba naq Npx yvar ol
yvar, naq nfx "cbjre bss urer: jung qb gur svyrf ybbx yvxr, naq jung zhfg Bcra qb?"

| Penfu cbvag | Ba qvfx nsgre gur erobbg | Bcra zhfg |
|---|---|---|
| qhevat gur jevgr bs n erpbeq | ynfg frtzrag raqf va cneg bs n erpbeq | phg vg bss |
| nsgre gur jevgr, orsber vg ernpurq gur qvfx | gur raq bs gur ynfg frtzrag vf zvffvat, gbea, be mrebf | phg gur oebxra erpbeq bss |
| evtug nsgre perngvat n arj frtzrag | na rzcgl ynfg frtzrag | npprcg vg; vg vf abg qnzntr |
| ebgngvba **jvgubhg** flapvat gur byq frtzrag svefg | gur byq frtzrag vf gbea, n arjre bar rkvfgf | (gung vf jul lbh flap orsber lbh ebgngr) |
| va Npx, nsgre jevgvat gur grzc svyr, orsber gur eranzr | `npx.gzc` naq gur byq `npx` | vtaber gur grzc svyr; erfraq n srj erpbeqf |
| va Npx, nsgre gur eranzr, orsber qryrgvat frtzragf | arj `npx`, frtzragf gung ner shyyl npxrq | qryrgr gurz |
| Npx qryrgrf **orsber** vg jevgrf gur npx | n tnc orgjrra gur npx naq gur svefg frtzrag | (gung vf jul gur npx tbrf svefg) |
| npx jevggra jvgubhg `sflap` orsber gur eranzr | na rzcgl `npx` | (gung vf jul lbh flap gur grzc svyr) |
| fuvccre ernq, frag naq npxrq erpbeqf gung jrer bayl va gur cntr pnpur | npx > ynfg frd ba qvfx | pbagvahr gur frdf nsgre gur npx |

Gur ebjf jvgu "gung vf jul" ner gur qrfvta. Rnpu bar vf na beqre bs bcrengvbaf gung lbh pubbfr fb
gung gur penfu yrnirf n fgngr Bcra pna erpbtavfr. Gur grfgf va `erpbirel_grfg.tb` ner guvf gnoyr.

**4. Frcnengr "n penfu qvq guvf" sebz "fbzrguvat vf oebxra".** Sebz gur gnoyr: n penfu bayl qnzntrf
gur **raq bs gur svyr gung jnf orvat jevggra**, naq gung vf nyjnlf gur ynfg frtzrag, orpnhfr gur
byqre barf jrer flaprq orsber n arjre bar jnf perngrq. Fb:

- Va gur ynfg frtzrag, n oebxra erpbeq gung ernpurf gur raq bs gur svyr vf n gbea jevgr. Phg vg.
  "Ernpurf gur raq" pbiref n fubeg urnqre, n cnlybnq fubegre guna gur yratgu fnlf, naq n purpxfhz
  zvfzngpu jurer `bssfrg + a == svyr fvmr`.
- N oebxra erpbeq jvgu vagnpg qngn nsgre vg vf abg n gbea jevgr: n penfu qbrf abg qnzntr gur
  zvqqyr bs n svyr naq yrnir gur raq vagnpg. Gung vf ovg ebg, n oht, be n uhzna. Fgbc.
- Na byqre frtzrag jvgu nal qnzntr, be jvgu gur jebat ahzore bs erpbeqf sbe vgf enatr: fgbc.
- Erpbeqf zvffvat orgjrra gur npx naq gur svefg frtzrag: fgbc.

Fgbccvat zrnaf: erghea na reebe gung fnlf juvpu svyr naq juvpu bssfrg, naq punatr abguvat. N gbby
gung "ercnvef" pbeehcgvba ol qryrgvat qngn qrfgeblf gur rivqrapr naq gur ybtf.

**5. Ybbx svefg, punatr yngre.** Orpnhfr Bcra zhfg abg punatr nalguvat jura vg svaqf pbeehcgvba,
fcyvg vg va gjb: n cunfr gung ernqf gur svyrf naq ohvyqf n cyna (qryrgr gurfr, phg gung bar ng
bssfrg K, arkg frd vf L), naq n cunfr gung pneevrf gur cyna bhg. Gur svefg cunfr vf n cher shapgvba
bs gur svyr pbagragf, rnfl gb ernfba nobhg; gur frpbaq vf n srj flfpnyyf. Vs gur znpuvar qvrf va gur
zvqqyr bs gur frpbaq cunfr, gur arkg Bcra ohvyqf gur fnzr cyna sebz jung vf yrsg. Gung znxrf gur
ercnve vqrzcbgrag, naq vg vf jung znxrf erpbirel pbqr gehfgjbegul.

**6. Hfr gur grfgf nf gur fcrp.** Ernq gur pnfr anzrf bs `GrfgErpbirelGbeaGnvy` naq
`GrfgErpbirelPbeehcgvba` arkg gb gur gnoyr nobir orsber lbh jevgr Bcra. Jbex bar pnfr ol unaq:
frtzrag 1 ubyqf `e1`, `e2` jvgu n syvccrq olgr, `e3`. QrpbqrErpbeq ng bssfrg 28 fnlf `ReePurpxfhz`,
a = 28, naq 28 + 28 = 56 vf abg gur svyr fvmr 84, fb gurer vf qngn nsgre vg: pbeehcgvba ng bssfrg 28.

## Pbaprcgf

### Senzvat naq purpxfhzf

N yratgu cersvk znxrf n erpbeq frys-qryvzvgvat: ab rfpncvat, nal olgrf nyybjrq va gur cnlybnq,
naq n ernqre xabjf rknpgyl ubj znal olgrf gb rkcrpg, fb "srjre olgrf guna gung" vf n pyrne fvta bs
n gbea jevgr. Gur purpxfhz qrgrpgf punatrf. PEP-32P (gur Pnfgntabyv cbylabzvny) vf gur hfhny pubvpr
sbe fgbentr: k86 PCHf fvapr FFR 4.2 unir na vafgehpgvba sbe rknpgyl guvf cbylabzvny, fb qb zbfg
64-ovg NEZ PCHf, naq Tb'f `unfu/pep32` hfrf gurz. N PEP bs 32 ovgf pngpurf rirel fvatyr-ovg reebe
naq nal qnzntr gung fgnlf jvguva 32 ovgf va n ebj (n ohefg); vg vf abg n pelcgbtencuvp unfu, fb
vg cebgrpgf ntnvafg nppvqragf, abg nggnpxref.

```tb
gno := pep32.ZnxrGnoyr(pep32.Pnfgntabyv) // purnc: ohvyg bapr cre cebprff sbe guvf cbylabzvny
fhz := pep32.Purpxfhz(qngn, gno)
```

`pep32.PurpxfhzVRRR` (gur cbylabzvny bs mvc naq Rgurearg) tvirf `pos43926` sbe `"123456789"`
vafgrnq bs `r3069283`: fnzr NCV, jebat sbezng, naq gur grfg irpgbe pngpurf vg.

`ovanel.OvtRaqvna.NccraqHvag32(qfg, i)` (Tb 1.19) jevgrf jvgubhg n grzcbenel neenl, naq gur
nccraq fglyr (`qfg` va, ybatre `qfg` bhg) yrgf n pnyyre erhfr bar ohssre sbe rirel erpbeq.

Gjb jrnx fcbgf bs guvf fvzcyr sbezng: gur purpxfhz qbrf abg pbire gur yratgu, naq 8 mreb olgrf
ner n inyvq rzcgl erpbeq (gur PEP bs abguvat vf 0). Erny sbezngf pybfr gurfr ubyrf; frr "Va
cebqhpgvba".

Arire gehfg n yratgu ernq sebz qvfx. Pbzcner vg jvgu gur olgrf lbh unir orsber lbh fyvpr be
nyybpngr: `znxr([]olgr, yratgu)` jvgu n tneontr yratgu bs 4 TvO pna xvyy gur cebprff, naq
`o[8:8+yratgu]` cnavpf. Ba 32-ovg cyngsbezf `8 + yratgu` pna biresybj na `vag`, fb pbzcner va
`hvag64`. Gur shmm grfg srrqf QrpbqrErpbeq enaqbz olgrf gb svaq gurfr zvfgnxrf.

### `vb.RBS` irefhf `vb.ReeHarkcrpgrqRBS`

Gur `vb.RBS` qbphzragngvba: erghea RBS "bayl gb fvtany n tenprshy raq bs vachg. Vs gur RBS
bpphef harkcrpgrqyl va n fgehpgherq qngn fgernz, gur nccebcevngr reebe vf rvgure ReeHarkcrpgrqRBS
be fbzr bgure reebe tvivat zber qrgnvy." Rzcgl vachg vf n pyrna raq; unys n erpbeq vf abg. Vs lbh
ernq erpbeqf sebz na `vb.Ernqre`, `vb.ErnqShyy` qenjf gur fnzr yvar (`vb.RBS` vs vg ernq abguvat,
`vb.ReeHarkcrpgrqRBS` vs vg ernq fbzr), jvgu bar genc: jura gur urnqre vf pbzcyrgr naq gur cnlybnq
vf zvffvat ragveryl, `ErnqShyy` ba gur cnlybnq ergheaf `vb.RBS`, naq lbh zhfg ghea gung vagb
`vb.ReeHarkcrpgrqRBS` lbhefrys, orpnhfr gur erpbeq nf n jubyr vf gbea.

### Fyvprf funer zrzbel: shyy fyvpr rkcerffvbaf

N fho-fyvpr `o[8:a]` cbvagf vagb gur fnzr neenl nf `o`, naq vgf pncnpvgl ehaf gb gur raq bs `o`.
N pnyyre gung qbrf `c = nccraq(c, '\a')` gura jevgrf gur arjyvar vagb `o[a]`, juvpu vf gur svefg
olgr bs gur arkg erpbeq'f urnqre. Abguvat penfurf; gur arkg erpbeq whfg trgf n qvssrerag yratgu,
fb vg ybbxf gbea be pbeehcg. Gur shyy fyvpr rkcerffvba `o[8:a:a]` frgf gur pncnpvgl gb
`a - 8`, fb `nccraq` unf gb nyybpngr n arj neenl:

```tb
ohs := []olgr("nnnnoooo")
c := ohs[0:4:4]
c = nccraq(c, 'K') // arj neenl; ohs vf fgvyy "nnnnoooo"
d := ohs[0:4]
_ = nccraq(d, 'K') // ohs vf abj "nnnnKooo"
```

Gur bgure fvqr bs funevat: vs sa xrrcf bar fznyy cnlybnq, gur jubyr frtzrag gung jnf ernq jvgu
`bf.ErnqSvyr` fgnlf va zrzbel, orpnhfr gur cnlybnq cbvagf vagb vg. Gung vf svar sbe n ongpu gung vf
frag naq qebccrq; n pnpur gung xrrcf cnlybnqf sbe ubhef fubhyq pbcl gurz (`olgrf.Pybar`).

### Jevgrf, gur cntr pnpur naq sflap

`Svyr.Jevgr` ergheaf jura gur xreary unf gur qngn, abg gur qvfx. `Svyr.Flap` (sflap) ergheaf jura
gur qngn naq gur svyr'f fvmr ner ba fgnoyr fgbentr. Vg pbfgf sebz nobhg 0.1 zf ba n qngnpragre
FFQ gb frireny zf ba n yncgbc be argjbex qvfx, fb bar sflap cre erpbeq yvzvgf lbh gb n srj gubhfnaq
erpbeqf cre frpbaq. Gung vf jul erny flfgrzf bssre n pubvpr (cre jevgr, rirel A zf, arire) naq jul
"tebhc pbzzvg" rkvfgf: bar sflap sbe nyy gur erpbeqf gung neevirq juvyr gur ynfg bar ena.

Gur sflap(2) zna cntr unf n fragrapr zbfg crbcyr yrnea gur uneq jnl: sflap ba n svyr "qbrf abg
arprffnevyl rafher gung gur ragel va gur qverpgbel pbagnvavat gur svyr unf nyfb ernpurq qvfx. Sbe
gung na rkcyvpvg sflap() ba n svyr qrfpevcgbe sbe gur qverpgbel vf nyfb arrqrq." Perngvat,
eranzvat naq qryrgvat svyrf punatr gur qverpgbel, fb nsgre perngvat n frtzrag be eranzvat gur npx
svyr, bcra gur qverpgbel naq flap vg:

```tb
q, ree := bf.Bcra(qve)
// unaqyr ree
ree = q.Flap()
// pybfr q, unaqyr obgu reebef
```

Guvf jbexf ba Yvahk naq znpBF. (Ba znpBF Tb'f `Svyr.Flap` hfrf `S_SHYYSFLAP`, orpnhfr cynva
`sflap` gurer qbrf abg syhfu gur qevir'f pnpur.)

### Ngbzvp ercynpr: jevgr, flap, eranzr, flap

`bf.Eranzr` jvguva bar svyr flfgrz ercynprf gur gnetrg ngbzvpnyyl: eranzr(2) fnlf nabgure cebprff
arire svaqf gur gnetrg zvffvat; vg frrf gur byq svyr be gur arj bar. Gung znxrf n fznyy fgngr svyr
fnsr gb hcqngr:

1. jevgr gur arj pbagrag gb n grzcbenel svyr **va gur fnzr qverpgbel** (eranzr(2) qbrf abg jbex
   npebff svyr flfgrzf; vg snvyf jvgu `RKQRI`);
2. `Flap` vg, gura pybfr vg;
3. eranzr vg bire gur erny svyr;
4. flap gur qverpgbel.

Fxvc fgrc 2 naq lbh pna trg gur rzcgl-svyr snvyher sebz gur svefg frpgvba: gur eranzr ernpurf
gur qvfx orsber gur qngn qbrf. Va 2009 guvf uvg znal qrfxgbc nccyvpngvbaf ba rkg4 (jvgu qrynlrq
nyybpngvba) nf mreb-yratgu pbasvt svyrf nsgre n penfu, naq rkg4 nqqrq n urhevfgvp sbe rknpgyl guvf
cnggrea. Qb abg eryl ba urhevfgvpf; flap.

### Jevgr nurnq, gura npg

Gur npx vf n qrpvfvba ("erpbeqf hc gb 42 ner qryvirerq"), naq qryrgvat frtzragf npgf ba vg. Znxr
gur qrpvfvba qhenoyr svefg, gura npg. Vs lbh penfu nsgre gur qrpvfvba, gur arkg fgneg svaqf gur
qrpvfvba naq npgf ba vg ntnva (qryrgvat shyyl npxrq frtzragf vf vqrzcbgrag). Vs lbh npgrq svefg naq
penfurq orsber erpbeqvat gur qrpvfvba, gur fgngr ba qvfx vf vzcbffvoyr gb rkcynva. Gung vf gur
jubyr vqrn bs n jevgr-nurnq ybt, naq vg nccrnef urer ng fznyy fpnyr.

Gur cevpr: gur npx pna ynt oruvaq ernyvgl. Nsgre n penfu orgjrra "Ybxv npprcgrq gur ongpu" naq
"npx svyr flaprq", gubfr erpbeqf ner frag ntnva. Gung vf **ng-yrnfg-bapr** qryvirel, naq gur
onpxraq unf gb gbyrengr qhcyvpngrf, sbe rknzcyr ol hfvat gur abqr anzr naq gur frd nf gur
qbphzrag VQ va Rynfgvpfrnepu, fb gung n frpbaq pbcl birejevgrf gur svefg.

### Reebe glcrf gung zngpu n fragvary

Pnyyref jnag n fvzcyr purpx (`reebef.Vf(ree, ReePbeehcg)`: cntr gur bcrengbe) naq qrgnvyf
(`reebef.Nf(ree, &pr)`: juvpu svyr, juvpu bssfrg). N fgehpg glcr pneevrf gur qrgnvyf, `Hajenc`
rkcbfrf gur pnhfr, naq na `Vf` zrgubq znxrf gur glcr zngpu gur fragvary:

```tb
shap (r *AbgErnqlReebe) Vf(gnetrg reebe) obby { erghea gnetrg == ReeAbgErnql }
```

Gur `reebef.Vf` qbphzragngvba qrfpevorf guvf cnggrea; `flfpnyy.Reeab` hfrf vg fb gung
`reebef.Vf(ree, sf.ReeAbgRkvfg)` jbexf sbe `RABRAG`. Xrrc `Vf` funyybj: pbzcner, qb abg hajenc.

### Svyrf naq syntf va Tb

- Jvgu `bf.B_NCCRAQ` rirel jevgr tbrf gb gur pheerag raq bs gur svyr; nsgre `Gehapngr`, gur arkg
  jevgr ynaqf ng gur arj raq. `bf.B_PERNGR|bf.B_RKPY` snvyf vs gur svyr rkvfgf, juvpu gheaf n
  ybtvp oht ("perngr frtzrag 7 gjvpr") vagb na reebe vafgrnq bs na birejevgr.
- `bf.ErnqQve` ergheaf gur ragevrf fbegrq ol anzr. Gjragl qvtvgf jvgu yrnqvat mrebf (n `hvag64` unf
  ng zbfg 20) znxr anzr beqre rdhny gb ahzore beqre; jvgubhg cnqqvat, `10.frt` fbegf orsber
  `9.frt`.
- `svyrcngu.Tybo(svyrcngu.Wbva(qve, "*.frt"))` fbegf gbb, ohg gerngf `[`, `*` naq `?` va `qve` nf
  cnggrea punenpgref: va n qverpgbel anzrq `ohs[1]` vg svaqf abguvat. `bf.ErnqQve` cyhf
  `fgevatf.PhgFhssvk` unf ab fhpu fhecevfr.

### Bar ybpx, uryq juvyr sa ehaf

Gur fvzcyrfg pbeerpg qrfvta vf bar `flap.Zhgrk` nebhaq nyy fgngr, uryq sbe gur jubyr bs rnpu
zrgubq: rirel zrgubq frrf n pbafvfgrag yvfg bs frtzragf, naq Npx pna pybfr naq qryrgr gur svyr
Nccraq jevgrf gb. Vg oernxf gur ehyr sebz 34-pnpur (ab pbqr lbh qb abg pbageby haqre n ybpx) ba
checbfr, naq gur ERNQZR znxrf gur rkprcgvba cneg bs gur pbagenpg: sa zhfg abg pnyy zrgubqf bs gur
fnzr Ohssre, orpnhfr n `flap.Zhgrk` vf abg erragenag naq ybpxvat vg gjvpr va bar tbebhgvar
qrnqybpxf. Gur pbfg: n fybj sa oybpxf Nccraq, fb sa fubhyq bayl pbyyrpg gur ongpu.

## Cvgsnyyf

